InitialConnection: `41`
ClientReason: `Disconnected`
ProtocolConstant: `DISCONNECTED`

This error appears when the Bedrock client was able to connect to your server, but disconnected at some point, for an unknown reason. Try checking your server logs for any connection attempts and possible errors.
